<title>UK: Bco Credito de Sao Paulo sets $40 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Bco Credito de Sao Paulo sets $40 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers WestMerchant and Marcep Overseas Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DE CREDITO DE SAO PAULO SA</p>
<p> AMT    $40 MLN	 COUPON   **10.55     MATURITY   *26.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8492   PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.8492   SPREAD	+445 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **COUPON STEPS UP TO 10.80 PCT IN YEAR 3, AND 11.05 PCT</p>
<p>		IN YEAR FIVE.</p>
<p>	     *PUTS AND CALLS AT PAR ON 26.JUN.00 AND 26.JUN.02</p>
<p>		PRICED OVER 3-YEAR PUT AND CALL.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
